  "name": "Question 6",
  "problem": "What fraction is missing from the statement below?\n\n$$\n2÷3\\times 9=2\\times \\frac{\\boxed{\\,\\,}}{\\boxed{\\,\\,}}\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "We can write an equivalent expression by swapping the $÷3$ and the $\\times 9:$\n\n$$\n2\\times 9÷3\n$$\n\nWe can now interpret the division as a fraction:\n\n$$\n2\\times \\frac{9}{3}\n$$",
